orks, ISP infrastructure, data centers, and high-bandwidth networking environments. Featuring 8 × Gigabit Ethernet RJ45 ports and 4 × 10G SFP+ ports, this switch provides fast and reliable connectivity for modern network infrastructures.</p><p><br></p><p>With up to 128Gbps switching capacity and 72Mpps forwarding performance, the BDCOM S2900-8T4X delivers efficient traffic handling for demanding business and networking applications. Its advanced Layer 3-Lite features, VLAN support, QoS, ACL, IPv4/IPv6 capabilities, and 10G uplinks make it an excellent choice for network aggregation and enterprise deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>8 × 10/100/1000Mbps Gigabit RJ45 Ethernet Ports</li><li>4 × 10G/1G SFP+ Uplink Ports</li><li>L3-Lite Managed Switch</li><li>Up to 128Gbps Switching Capacity</li><li>Up to 72Mpps Forwarding Rate</li><li>16K MAC Address Table</li><li>9K Jumbo Frame Support</li><li>VLAN, QinQ and Link Aggregation Support</li><li>STP/RSTP/MSTP Support</li><li>Advanced ACL and QoS Features</li><li>IPv4/IPv6 Network Support</li><li>Static Routing and advanced Layer 3 features</li><li>SNMP, SSH, Telnet, HTTP/HTTPS Management</li><li>19-inch 1U Rack-Mountable Design</li><li>Suitable for Enterprise, ISP and Data Center Networks</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX 48x 10/25GbE SFP28 + 6x 100GbE QSFP28 Network Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-9300-n9k-c93180yc-ex-48x-1025gbe-sfp28-6x-100gbe-qsfp28-network-switch","now":"155,000৳","old":"160,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ L3 Web Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-l3-web-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"24,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco Nexus N3K-3064PQ-10GX –48-Port 10G SFP+ Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-n3k-3064pq-10gx-%E2%80%9348-port-10g-sfp